* "American 5153" preamp, stage 2 of 7: channel THREE (RED), the other input stage (driven by the guitar too): V1A, the THREE GAIN network, V4A and V4B up to the coupling C27 (node n27).
* The supply behind R95 carries a dummy load for the currents of stage 5 (V5A, V5B, V6A).

V VRAIL x 100 341
R R95 x w 10k
C C36 w 0 22u
C C40 x 0 47u
R Rdummy_w w 0 131k
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p
R RIN in 0 1M
R R47 in a47 10k
R R49 a47 0 1M
C C22 a47 0 39p
R R48 a47 g1a 68k
T V1A g1a p1a k1a 12AX7
R R82 w p1a 220k
R R33 k1a 0 1.8k
C C17 k1a 0 1u
C C16 p1a n16 470p
R R28 n16 0 1M
R VR11T n16 w11 1
R VR11B w11 0 1
C C15 n16 w11 1n
R R29 w11 0 1M
R R61 w11 q1 470k
R R62 q1 g4a 10k
T V4A g4a p4a k4a 12AX7
R R87 w p4a 100k
R R39 k4a 0 1.8k
C C19 k4a 0 1u
C C32 p4a n32 1n
R R64 n32 g4b 470k
R R63 g4b 0 1M
T V4B g4b p4b k4b 12AX7
R R78 w p4b 100k
C C26 w p4b 1n
R R65 k4b 0 39k
C C27 p4b n27 22n
R R66 n27 0 330k
